<title>FRANCE: New car sales in France rose 10.5 percent.</title>
<headline>New car sales in France rose 10.5 percent.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS</dateline>
<text>
<p>New car sales in France last year rose by 10.5 percent to 2.13 million, the highest figure since 1992, the French carmakers association CCFA said Thursday.</p>
<p>The market was underpinned by a 12-month state-sponsored incentive programme that ended in September, the CCFA said.</p>
